Whirling in Rags was a [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] of [[Org/Garrick Textiles/index|Garrick Textiles]], the Heart of the Org's berth aboard the [[Org/The Harlequins/Providence|Providence]]. It took the shape of a bolt of fabric that folded itself into a face. Its core was taken and fed to [[Org/Iconoclasm/Eerie|Eerie]], and the fane it had raised, the marble hall and wings [[Org/Garrick Textiles/People/Letov Obratz|Letov Obratz]] began, collapsed with it.
